"text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/middle-east/20261010-yemen-says-forces-made-advances-against-houthis-around-key-waterway" /><summary type="html">Yemen said Saturday that forces were advancing against the Houthis around the Bab al-Mandab strait. This comes a week after the country's Saudi-backed government announced that it was initiating a counter-offensive to take back territory seized by the pro-Iran group during last month's lightning offensive.</summary><category term="Middle East" /></entry><entry><title>🔴 Palestinian president Abbas postpones legislative elections, sets presidential poll for September 2027</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e2e9028244ba222321090c3ea6d62ba5ae014df6497a2e278bd932a8191950e1</id><updated>2026-10-10T14:33:08Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T11:58:24Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/middle-east/20261010-palestinian-president-abbas-postpones-legislative-elections-to-september-2027--79eb133759e7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/middle-east/20261010-palestinian-president-abbas-postpones-legislative-elections-to-september-2027" /></entry><entry><title>Palestinian president Abbas postpones legislative, presidential elections to September 2027</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c2c41224cb0706e354d25bde16801b9b0129b5d1d66f2b4a4852ef73fce70a72</id><updated>2026-10-10T14:33:08Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T11:56:40Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/middle-east/20261010-palestinian-president-abbas-postpones-legislative-elections-to-september-2027--79eb133759e7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/middle-east/20261010-palestinian-president-abbas-postpones-legislative-elections-to-september-2027" /><summary type="html">⁠⁠Palestinian president ​Mahmoud ​Abbas announced on Saturday that legislative ⁠elections would be postponed from November ​28 to September ​11, 2027, the ​official Palestinian news agency ⁠WAFA reported. In his presidential decree, Abbas set the next presidential elections for that day as well.</summary><category term="Middle East" /></entry><entry><title>October 7 scars push Israel's first-time voters to right</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c843c4efe65ba478e76247f62be1d384744d34c85a40b5693c49c5e36eef16d6</id><updated>2026-10-10T14:33:11Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T11:01:20Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261010-october-7-scars-push-israel-s-first-time-voters-to-right--a4d681b52038.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261010-october-7-scars-push-israel-s-first-time-voters-to-right" /><summary type="html">Like hundreds of thousands of Israelis, Amihai will be of voting age for the first time since Hamas carried out its attack on October 7, 2023. When he casts his ballot this month, he has one priority above all -- security.</summary></entry><entry><title>Hunger and malnutrition stalk Gazans, a year on from ceasefire</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ffbd5346544d4bfe937be232915260ba6d9dec01991dbb13ce6ce10b7b012135</id><updated>2026-10-10T14:33:14Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T11:00:08Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261010-hunger-and-malnutrition-stalk-gazans-a-year-on-from-ceasefire--48988060ff3b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261010-hunger-and-malnutrition-stalk-gazans-a-year-on-from-ceasefire" /><summary type="html">Every day, Gazan mother Niyaha al-Masri spends six exhausting hours or more queueing at a community kitchen in the hope of getting some food for her family. It has been a year since a ceasefire between Hamas and Israel was supposed to allow food to flood into the ruined territory, yet widespread hunger persists there.</summary></entry><entry><title>Severe injuries at French student protests draw scrutiny to police tactics</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:9f28fd46b0983e49fb38424535c42b67d9457bf70ffd758cafca4db09e68de2a</id><updated>2026-10-10T14:33:17Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T10:20:54Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/france/20261010-injuries-french-student-protests-draw-scrutiny-to-police-tactics--364db9c4aa5f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/france/20261010-injuries-french-student-protests-draw-scrutiny-to-police-tactics" /><summary type="html">Twenty-four investigations have been opened by French police watchdog IGPN into incidents linked to the ongoing high school protest movement, the interior ministry said. The police response has reignited calls to scrap rubber bullets and launcher-fired riot-control weapons, long denounced by rights groups and UN experts as dangerous and excessive.</summary><category term="France" /></entry><entry><title>Navanethem 'Navi' Pillay wins the Nobel Peace Prize</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:8475b099698beb51bc081874e76a22fc3e5b0223d7860e98ccef55a0ecceb1d3</id><updated>2026-10-10T14:33:20Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T09:25:54Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261010-navanethem-navi-pillay-wins-the-nobel-peace-prize--5d7ba615865b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261010-navanethem-navi-pillay-wins-the-nobel-peace-prize" /><summary type="html">Former UN human rights chief Navanethem "Navi" Pillay, a judge at the International Court of Justice, won the Nobel Peace Prize on Friday in Oslo, Norway.</summary></entry><entry><title>India's 'cockroach' movement: "This is unprecedented"</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f2b8fe9fe24f7facf32a55c7f82280d62c0fcc1eb76014781311d6a2ff5c653a</id><updated>2026-10-10T14:33:23Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T09:20:21Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261010-india-s-cockroach-movement-this-is-unprecedented--837dde280215.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261010-india-s-cockroach-movement-this-is-unprecedented" /><summary type="html">Indian police detained Abhijeet Dipke, head of the satirical Cockroach Janta Party (CJP) movement, on Saturday ahead of a major protest against the Election Commission, the party said.

"This is unprecedented," our guest Subir Sinha, director of the SOAS South Asia Institute, says.</summary></entry><entry><title>India detains 'cockroach' leaders ahead of election protest</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1434952a73d46012c699190120863f357431aa2e01afb0ad215ff5614320c370</id><updated>2026-10-10T14:33:26Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T09:18:11Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261010-india-detains-cockroach-leaders-ahead-of-election-protest--da3c1675b34a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261010-india-detains-cockroach-leaders-ahead-of-election-protest" /><summary type="html">Indian police detained the head of the satirical "cockroach" online movement on Saturday, the group said, ahead of a major protest against the Election Commission that triggered strict security measures. Our correspondent Navodita Kumari tells us more.</summary></entry><entry><title>France: Scientists conduct microgravity experiments on parabolic flights</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:992ac27ab26ffffb1fb4c5267adb3dc1863c5a4d178897dc66db6fc3a57ec68e</id><updated>2026-10-10T14:33:29Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T09:15:56Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261010-france-scientists-conduct-microgravity-experiments-on-parabolic-flights--dd02ddebe65e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261010-france-scientists-conduct-microgravity-experiments-on-parabolic-flights" /><summary type="html">This week in Bordeaux, the CNES, the French space agency, launched a microgravity research campaign with scientists from all over the world. It gave them the opportunity to conduct experiments in weightlessness during parabolic flights aboard a specially equipped Airbus, without having to send their equipment into space.
 
Our reporters James André and Sylvain Rousseau joined them on board.</summary></entry><entry><title>Trump hails Russia deal to release diesel as midterms loom</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ab797075605b26d14e551ec56b73da2f582240185b9ca80ebd88e1b672832838</id><updated>2026-10-10T14:33:32Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T09:12:51Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261010-trump-hails-russia-deal-to-release-diesel-as-midterms-loom--4f9dfbaf0b79.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261010-trump-hails-russia-deal-to-release-diesel-as-midterms-loom" /><summary type="html">US President Donald Trump said Friday that he had secured Russia's agreement for a major release of diesel, as he eased war sanctions on Moscow in a push to lower energy costs ahead of midterm elections.</summary></entry><entry><title>Live: Russian strikes on Ukraine kill at least 15 in Zaporizhzhia, cause power outages in Kyiv</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:37745f8910e34399e81965ef1447f6aa9842ad97b53b45525298a12ba89b5a35</id><updated>2026-10-10T14:33:35Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T08:41:39Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/europe/20261010-live-russian-strikes-on-ukraine-zaporizhzhia-kill-least-seven-including-children--2e66a7264c75.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20261010-live-russian-strikes-on-ukraine-zaporizhzhia-kill-least-seven-including-children" /><summary type="html">Russian strikes on the southeastern Ukrainian city of Zaporizhzhia killed at least 15 people, including three children, regional authorities said on Saturday. The attack also caused "large-scale power outages" in the capital Kyiv and the surrounding region. Follow our liveblog for the latest developments.</summary><category term="Europe" /></entry><entry><title>'All human emotions': French astronaut Sophie Adenot returns to Earth</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:afec0aa163394c612710c3e7f52502470e9674dcf7ef161b31643531cdeef349</id><updated>2026-10-10T14:33:38Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T08:09:18Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/europe/20261010-all-human-emotion-french-astronaut-sophie-adenot-first-words-since-returning-earth--55457d343553.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20261010-all-human-emotion-french-astronaut-sophie-adenot-first-words-since-returning-earth" /><summary type="html">French astronaut Sophie Adenot said she experienced “the full range of human emotions, from the most joyful to the most difficult” during her eight months in space, speaking on Saturday in Cologne, Germany, in her first public appearance since returning to Earth.</summary><category term="Europe" /></entry><entry><title>US, Europe and Ukraine hold 'constructive discussions' on joint plan to end war</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:51722fae3c8119941deb7016372cbbf1c66278e71ca04129cf450a17d45e0e67</id><updated>2026-10-10T14:33:41Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T07:47:39Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/americas/20261010-us-ukrainians-europeans-discuss-new-ideas-to-end-war-diesel--5af96e215021.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261010-us-ukrainians-europeans-discuss-new-ideas-to-end-war-diesel" /><summary type="html">US, Ukrainian and European negotiators held talks in Miami on Friday to seek a common proposal to end the war in Ukraine, as President Donald Trump's decision to ease restrictions on Russian fuel drew criticism from lawmakers and Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky.</summary><category term="Americas" /></entry><entry><title>‘So safe you could drink it’: Scientists and pesticide victims fear an EU rollback</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:5c2db5648bc61186aedfa9b5ef6ea1ecb1693478bc1b84b1db659b353aa8b28a</id><updated>2026-10-10T14:33:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T07:10:25Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/europe/20261010-so-safe-you-could-drink-it-scientists-and-pesticide-victims-fear-an-eu-rollback--79f5867b4455.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20261010-so-safe-you-could-drink-it-scientists-and-pesticide-victims-fear-an-eu-rollback" /><summary type="html">For decades, French farmers sprayed pesticides they were told were harmless. Many have since fallen ill, grappling with cancers and other diseases caused by exposure. As the EU prepares to vote on a package that would end regular safety reviews of most pesticides, victims, doctors and scientists warn it could keep harmful products on the market for longer.</summary><category term="Europe" /></entry><entry><title>India's 'cockroach' movement chief detained ahead of major protest</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d9a54d5ac4a713dc945241b405e5fe416f76a30b38636a652897bf832f708979</id><updated>2026-10-10T14:33:47Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T06:37:40Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/asia-pacific/20261010-india-s-cockroach-movement-chief-detained-ahead-of-major-protest--c11b066f94fc.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/asia-pacific/20261010-india-s-cockroach-movement-chief-detained-ahead-of-major-protest" /><summary type="html">Police detained hundreds of protesters, including movement leaders, in the Indian capital on Saturday as authorities deployed thousands of security personnel, suspended transport and telecommunications services, and imposed sweeping restrictions to thwart a youth-led demonstration demanding the resignation of the country's election chief.</summary><category term="Asia / Pacific" /></entry><entry><title>Palestinians struggle to find food in Gaza one year after ceasefire</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3125e1139ebf1e097820c24ea00317ca88bf3a1569c6d652e4e4ad737eeeb923</id><updated>2026-10-10T14:33:50Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T04:31:42Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/middle-east/20261010-hunger-and-malnutrition-stalk-gazans-a-year-on-from-ceasefire--12017f60e848.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/middle-east/20261010-hunger-and-malnutrition-stalk-gazans-a-year-on-from-ceasefire" /><summary type="html">Widespread hunger remains persistent in the Gaza Strip despite the ceasefire agreement between Hamas and Israel a year ago that was supposed to allow more food into the Palestinian territory. A new study published on Thursday by Médecins du Monde reported that 93 percent of pregnant or breastfeeding women had symptoms of anaemia, which is closely linked to malnutrition.</summary><category term="Middle East" /></entry><entry><title>South African judge awarded Nobel Peace Prize</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:39938ef012529b2515f45ccf7a25984103101d63266fefe6a2e93f9a48a70f84</id><updated>2026-10-10T14:32:01Z</updated><published>2026-10-09T21:53:23Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/south-african-judge-awarded-nobel-peace-prize--abdd3a99d080.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/south-african-judge-awarded-nobel-peace-prize" /><summary type="html">In tonight's programme, South African judge and human rights champion Navi Pillay has been awarded the Nobel Peace Prize. Also in Kenya health officials in Nairobi are still racing to track dozens of people linked to the man who died from the virus earlier this week. And finally, Moroccan-British photographer Hassan Hajjaj has built a global reputation with his vibrant portraits, 40 of his iconic Rock Stars pictures are taking centre stage in Paris.</summary><category term="Eye on Africa" /></entry><entry><title>Italy's biggest-ever wine heist</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b0329e429d11c0f9d992216937a6d1ee83b2f18818b60260e00316e5a4cb6a5d</id><updated>2026-10-10T14:32:01Z</updated><published>2026-10-09T20:08:41Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261009-italy-s-biggest-ever-wine-heist--5d4a20ca2b50.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261009-italy-s-biggest-ever-wine-heist" /><summary type="html">A multi million euro wine heist in Italy. As thieves in Tuscany steal 30 thousand bottles of the one of the most iconic labels in the country from a warehouse of the the prized Marchesi Antinori winery as it prepared for a major export. The company said in the past few hours, they believe two vans and up to six thieves were involved. Gavin Lee speaks to France 24's correspondent in Rome, Seema Gupta.</summary></entry><entry><title>Trump strikes diesel deal with Putin, reversing years of pressure on Russia over Ukraine war</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:048b18356b7d348ea986c4427b3c3a4f31697fd00c55ccbbd596e846aab942e9</id><updated>2026-10-10T14:32:01Z</updated><published>2026-10-09T20:00:24Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/europe/20261009-trump-strikes-diesel-deal-with-putin-reversing-years-of-pressure-on-russia-over-ukraine-war--81c65c075c6e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20261009-trump-strikes-diesel-deal-with-putin-reversing-years-of-pressure-on-russia-over-ukraine-war" /><summary type="html">US President Donald Trump said Friday that Russia had agreed to immediately supply more than 300,000 tonnes of diesel to US and global markets in an effort to cut fuel prices before November's midterm elections. The move marks a stunning change of policy after the US and its allies hit Russia with waves of sanctions over its invasion of Ukraine.</summary><category term="Europe" /></entry><entry><title>Paris court jails Indian man for leading sadist neo-Nazi cult that tortured girls</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:36d82c8ab5cb5e4107755bf2a3d9ba859d3d7da07ee65df34deed323fd69217b</id><updated>2026-10-10T14:32:01Z</updated><published>2026-10-09T19:45:41Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/france/20261009-paris-court-jails-indian-man-for-leading-sadist-neo-nazi-cult-that-tortured-girls--2e156af0653d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/france/20261009-paris-court-jails-indian-man-for-leading-sadist-neo-nazi-cult-that-tortured-girls" /><summary type="html">A 29-year-old Indian man was sentenced to 20 years in prison Friday in a Paris trial over his alleged involvement in an international criminal network that targeted vulnerable children in the US, Britain and Canada and coerced them into producing violent and sexual videos.</summary><category term="France" /></entry><entry><title>🔴 Powerful 7.6 magnitude quake shakes Panama, triggering tsunami warning</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:587c44c58e8ae58003285c2504394036be8a3320d94662eae937f7641e3b0d11</id><updated>2026-10-10T14:32:01Z</updated><published>2026-10-09T18:41:26Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/americas/20261009-powerful-7-6-magnitude-quake-shakes-panama-triggering-tsunami-warning--2b8cfe163ef0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261009-powerful-7-6-magnitude-quake-shakes-panama-triggering-tsunami-warning" /></entry><entry><title>Powerful 7.6 magnitude quake shakes Panama, triggering tsunami warnings</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7b10c4d6cf03704a418bce7c75d2bd69b247b4b9e8a1f8a2090f7a1e0e758ffb</id><updated>2026-10-10T14:32:01Z</updated><published>2026-10-09T18:39:03Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/americas/20261009-powerful-7-6-magnitude-quake-shakes-panama-triggering-tsunami-warning--2b8cfe163ef0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261009-powerful-7-6-magnitude-quake-shakes-panama-triggering-tsunami-warning" /><summary type="html">A strong 7.6 magnitude earthquake struck near the southern ​coast ‌of Panama ⁠on Friday at a 10 km depth, ‌according to the US Geological ⁠Survey, shaking buildings as far away as the capital and prompting evacuations. The US Tsunami Warning ​System showed potential tsunami threats across much of Central America's Pacific ​coast.</summary><category term="Americas" /></entry></feed>
